         "id": "SECTION_lifeuniverse",
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "<p><h3>Life and the Universe</h3>When we talk about all life, about the creation of planets and stars, the numbers used to talk about time become much larger, according to our measurements of the universe.</p><p>Our current measurements show that the universe is more than 13 billion years old, and that planet Earth is less than 5 billion years old (<htcite0> ; <htcite1>).</p>",
               "source": [
                  {
                     "type": 1,
